# Vulnerabilities deliberately allowed past the scanner (sp7-plan.md, DF8).
#
# Every line needs three things: the identifier, why it does not apply here or
# why it cannot be fixed yet, and a date to look again. An entry with no date
# is an entry nobody will ever remove.
#
# Empty on purpose. A finding is fixed by updating the image or the dependency;
# this file is for the case where neither is possible yet, and that case has to
# be argued rather than assumed.
